      "text": "\n$3 x-4 y+8=0$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tw4Aa",
      "text": "\n$4 x-3 y+4=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of tangent to hyperbola having slope $m$ is\n$$\ny=m x+\\sqrt{9 m^2-4}\n$$\nEquation of tangent to circle is\n$$\ny=m(x-4)+\\sqrt{16 m^2+16}\n$$\nEqs. (i) and (ii) will be identical for $m=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$ satisfy.\n$\\therefore$ Equation of common tangent is $2 x-\\sqrt{5} y+4=0$",
    "image": null
